description: Run Omarchy shell/theme/wallpaper/IPC commands from a background or agent shell (opencode serve, systemd, telegram) that has no Hyprland session env. Use when calling `omarchy*` binaries, `omarchy-shell` IPC, or changing backgrounds/themes from an agent context and silent `exit=1` / no-visible-effect crops up.
